    {
      "source": "Handle errors sent from the server side to clients, for example, errors from the\n<a href=\"../../../messaging/simp/stomp/StompBrokerRelayMessageHandler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.simp.stomp\"><code>\"broke relay\"</code></a> because connectivity failed or the external broker sent an\nerror message, etc.",
      "translation": "处理从服务器端发送到客户端的错误，例如由于连接失败或外部代理发送错误消息等原因导致的来自 <a href=\"../../../messaging/simp/stomp/StompBrokerRelayMessageHandler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.simp.stomp\"><code>\"broke relay\"</code></a> 的错误等。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "the error message to send to the client, or <code>null</code> in which\ncase no message will be sent.",
      "translation": "要发送给客户端的错误消息，或为 `<code>null</code>` 的情况，此时将不发送任何消息。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Note that the STOMP protocol requires a server to close the connection\nafter sending an ERROR frame. To prevent an ERROR frame from being sent,\na handler could return <code>null</code> and send a notification message\nthrough the broker instead, for example, via a user destination.",
      "translation": "请注意，STOMP 协议要求服务器在发送 ERROR 帧后关闭连接。为了防止发送 ERROR 帧，处理器可以返回 `<code>null</code>` 并通过代理发送通知消息，例如通过用户目的地。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"SubProtocolErrorHandler.html#handleClientMessageProcessingError(org.springframework.messaging.Message,java.lang.Throwable)\">SubProtocolErrorHandler</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"SubProtocolErrorHandler.html#handleClientMessageProcessingError(org.springframework.messaging.Message,java.lang.Throwable)\">SubProtocolErrorHandler</a></code></span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
