      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"SubProtocolErrorHandler.html#handleErrorMessageToClient(org.springframework.messaging.Message)\">SubProtocolErrorHandler</a></code></span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"SubProtocolErrorHandler.html#handleClientMessageProcessingError(org.springframework.messaging.Message,java.lang.Throwable)\">handleClientMessageProcessingError</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"SubProtocolErrorHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket.messaging\">SubProtocolErrorHandler</a>&lt;byte[]&gt;</code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"SubProtocolErrorHandler.html#handleClientMessageProcessingError(org.springframework.messaging.Message,java.lang.Throwable)\">handleClientMessageProcessingError</a></code>` 在接口 `<code><a href=\"SubProtocolErrorHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket.messaging\">SubProtocolErrorHandler</a>&lt;byte[]&gt;</code>` 中",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"SubProtocolErrorHandler.html#handleErrorMessageToClient(org.springframework.messaging.Message)\">handleErrorMessageToClient</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"SubProtocolErrorHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket.messaging\">SubProtocolErrorHandler</a>&lt;byte[]&gt;</code>",
      "translation": "`SubProtocolErrorHandler` 接口中的 `<a href=\"SubProtocolErrorHandler.html#handleErrorMessageToClient(org.springframework.messaging.Message)\">handleErrorMessageToClient</a>` 方法，类型为 `<code><a href=\"SubProtocolErrorHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket.messaging\">SubProtocolErrorHandler</a>&lt;byte[]&gt;</code>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>clientMessage</code> - the client message related to the error, possibly\n<code>null</code> if error occurred while parsing a WebSocket message",
      "translation": "<code>clientMessage</code> - 与错误相关的客户端消息，如果是在解析 WebSocket 消息时发生错误，则可能为 <code>null</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>ex</code> - the cause for the error, never <code>null</code>",
