      "translation": "<code>errorMessage</code> - 错误消息，永远不为 <code>null</code>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "A <a href=\"SubProtocolErrorHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket.messaging\"><code>SubProtocolErrorHandler</code></a> for use with STOMP.",
      "translation": "用于 STOMP 的 `<a href=\"SubProtocolErrorHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket.messaging\"><code>SubProtocolErrorHandler</code></a>`。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Handle errors thrown while processing client messages providing an\nopportunity to prepare the error message or to prevent one from being sent.",
      "translation": "处理在客户端消息处理过程中抛出的错误，提供准备错误消息或阻止发送该消息的机会。",
